copy     EFI/OC/Kexts/IntelXe.kext (version 9.9.9)
config   Kernel > Add, item 14 (IntelXe.kext): Enabled false -> true
copy     EFI/OC/Kexts/HybridPM.kext (version 9.9.8; this CPU has efficiency cores: it corrects their clocks)
config   Kernel > Add: add HybridPM.kext below Lilu.kext, as item 1 (ExecutablePath Contents/MacOS/HybridPM, PlistPath Contents/Info.plist, Enabled)
config   Misc > Security > ExposeSensitiveData: 6 -> 7 (OpenCore then records which EFI it booted from, for this script)
note     not added: SSDT-ARCOFF.aml. No Arc B580 found on this machine, so its ACPI path cannot be checked (stage 4, step 2 of README-INSTALL.md)
